      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我自我介绍自己是特雷森学园的训练员，\r\n并指出她看起来还需要接着休息――",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9e5ea2c97a3ecd442cb96c1a43637abda7dc3190f01b4e61d5a66617e6e3721",
