      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我父亲孜孜不倦地积累业绩，按其计划开了家自己的店。\r\n我母亲跑完了比赛，又马不停蹄地迈向人生第二春……",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ee1809c931f5a4c5df8357d938d3518b4a1b3a74ea41a85dbeb00fd4c127bb4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
